# Aspire / azd: the live deployment manifest is ephemeral and regenerated on demand.
# NOTE: infra/ (incl. *.module.bicep) IS committed and is the source of truth for the Azure deploy.
# We generated it with `azd infra gen` to hand-fix the Azure SQL bootstrap script (upstream module bug)
# and to declare the Cosmos vector container, so it must not be ignored. See docs/adr.
aspire-manifest.json

